    {
      "displayText": "I just came by to deliver a cup of coffee to Vinnie,\nbut he was so busy that he put me in charge here!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo, um, I guess I’m running the Rogue Mega\nEvolution Simulator 3000 now?",
