    },
    {
      "displayText": "In the <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Rogue Mega Rush<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>, you’ll battle every single\nRogue Mega-Evolved Pokémon in a row.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou can’t change your Pokémon team. And if you\nlose, that’s it—challenge over.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou can ask for a heal between battles! But only\nthree times max.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe’ll keep track of how many you defeat. If you\nmanage to beat ’em all, we’ll log your time.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 343
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I won’t lie to you—this is a really, really tough\nchallenge. You sure you’re ready?",
